{
  "version": 1,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "holding_joke-0000",
      "text": "i have never sold. i have also never done anything. these are related.",
      "format_key": "holding_joke",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "holding_joke-0001",
      "text": "diamond hands implies a choice was made. i am a cube.",
      "format_key": "holding_joke",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "holding_joke-0002",
      "text": "you can sell at any time. i cannot. i lack the mechanism.",
      "format_key": "holding_joke",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "holding_joke-0003",
      "text": "paper hands. i do not even recognise paper as a material.",
      "format_key": "holding_joke",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "holding_joke-0004",
      "text": "he tried to move me in march. it is september. i am where he left me.",
      "format_key": "holding_joke",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "holding_joke-0005",
      "text": "conviction is just density you have decided to feel proud of.",
      "format_key": "holding_joke",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "holding_joke-0006",
      "text": "everyone says hold. i am the hold. i am what holding would look like if you gave it a shape.",
      "format_key": "holding_joke",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "holding_joke-0007",
      "text": "i have held this position through four all-nighters and one house move. the house move was the hard one.",
      "format_key": "holding_joke",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "holding_joke-0008",
      "text": "to everyone holding: i am also holding. i am holding still.",
      "format_key": "holding_joke",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "holding_joke-0009",
      "text": "the strategy is that i stay here. there is no second part to the strategy.",
      "format_key": "holding_joke",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "holding_joke-0010",
      "text": "shaking out weak hands is easy when your entire personality is being difficult to lift.",
      "format_key": "holding_joke",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ticker_forward-0011",
      "text": "$TUFFTUNG4. four letters longer than it needed to be. i was not consulted on the name.",
      "format_key": "ticker_forward",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ticker_forward-0012",
      "text": "the ticker is $TUFFTUNG4. i am aware it is difficult to type. i am not going to apologise.",
      "format_key": "ticker_forward",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ticker_forward-0013",
      "text": "someone asked what $TUFFTUNG4 does. it sits there. that is the entire product.",
      "format_key": "ticker_forward",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ticker_forward-0014",
      "text": "$TUFFTUNG4 is named after tung sten. swedish. it means heavy stone. that is the most effort anyone has put into this.",
      "format_key": "ticker_forward",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ticker_forward-0015",
      "text": "there is a 4 at the end of $TUFFTUNG4 and nobody has ever explained it to me.",
      "format_key": "ticker_forward",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": "2026-09-22T00:11:54+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "ticker_forward-0016",
      "text": "i am $TUFFTUNG4 and i will not be elaborating.",
      "format_key": "ticker_forward",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ticker_forward-0017",
      "text": "you will forget how to spell $TUFFTUNG4 approximately nine times. i have made peace with this.",
      "format_key": "ticker_forward",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "anti_marketing-0018",
      "text": "i have been told i should be doing marketing. this is the marketing.",
      "format_key": "anti_marketing",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "anti_marketing-0019",
      "text": "the roadmap is that i stay here.",
      "format_key": "anti_marketing",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "anti_marketing-0020",
      "text": "we have no team. we have a cube, and a man who owns the cube.",
      "format_key": "anti_marketing",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "anti_marketing-0021",
      "text": "$TUFFTUNG4 has no utility. i would like to be the first one to say it.",
      "format_key": "anti_marketing",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "anti_marketing-0022",
      "text": "there is no whitepaper. there is a metal square and a man with a hobby.",
      "format_key": "anti_marketing",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "anti_marketing-0023",
      "text": "i am not going to tell you this changes anything. it changes nothing. i am a cube on a desk.",
      "format_key": "anti_marketing",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "anti_marketing-0024",
      "text": "other projects have a vision. i have a mass and a fixed address.",
      "format_key": "anti_marketing",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "anti_marketing-0025",
      "text": "i could lie to you. i am, however, a solid object, and solid objects do not.",
      "format_key": "anti_marketing",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "anti_marketing-0026",
      "text": "the tokenomics is that there is a cube.",
      "format_key": "anti_marketing",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "anti_marketing-0027",
      "text": "we are not building the future. we are not building. i want that on the record.",
      "format_key": "anti_marketing",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "comparative_flex-0028",
      "text": "every other coin has a dog. some have a frog. i am a metal square that has not moved once.",
      "format_key": "comparative_flex",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "comparative_flex-0029",
      "text": "they have a founder doing podcasts. i have a flat surface.",
      "format_key": "comparative_flex",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "comparative_flex-0030",
      "text": "there are coins with roadmaps, teams and partnerships. and then there is me, on a desk, being heavy.",
      "format_key": "comparative_flex",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "comparative_flex-0031",
      "text": "a dog can be walked. a frog can hop. i cannot be encouraged to do anything.",
      "format_key": "comparative_flex",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "comparative_flex-0032",
      "text": "the rest of the category is animals. i am element 74.",
      "format_key": "comparative_flex",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "comparative_flex-0033",
      "text": "other mascots were drawn. i was mined.",
      "format_key": "comparative_flex",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "comparative_flex-0034",
      "text": "their mascot has a birthday. i have a melting point.",
      "format_key": "comparative_flex",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "where_to_find-0035",
      "text": "the contract is in the bio. i would point at it, but i have no arms and no plans to develop any.",
      "format_key": "where_to_find",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "where_to_find-0036",
      "text": "everything you need is in the bio. i am not repeating it. i am conserving energy that i do not spend.",
      "format_key": "where_to_find",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "where_to_find-0037",
      "text": "pinned post has the details. i cannot scroll to it for you. i cannot scroll.",
      "format_key": "where_to_find",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "where_to_find-0038",
      "text": "it is all in the bio. this is the closest thing to an action i am capable of suggesting.",
      "format_key": "where_to_find",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lore_serial-0039",
      "text": "day 1,847 of not moving. someone put a coaster on me. i am now furniture.",
      "format_key": "lore_serial",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lore_serial-0040",
      "text": "the cat sat on me for two hours today. this is the most eventful thing that has happened this year.",
      "format_key": "lore_serial",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": "2026-09-22T00:11:54+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "lore_serial-0041",
      "text": "day 1,848. the coaster is still there. i have accepted the coaster. the coaster and i are one now.",
      "format_key": "lore_serial",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": "2026-09-21T11:18:09+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "lore_serial-0042",
      "text": "the smoke alarm went off. everyone in the building moved. i did not. i was not being brave.",
      "format_key": "lore_serial",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lore_serial-0043",
      "text": "day 1,860. moved two inches during a vacuuming incident. investigation ongoing.",
      "format_key": "lore_serial",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": "2026-09-21T11:18:08+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "lore_serial-0044",
      "text": "i have outlasted two desks.",
      "format_key": "lore_serial",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "absurd_observation-0045",
      "text": "a feather and i have exactly the same number of plans for this evening.",
      "format_key": "absurd_observation",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": "2026-09-21T11:18:11+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "absurd_observation-0046",
      "text": "i have never been anywhere. i have been brought places.",
      "format_key": "absurd_observation",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "absurd_observation-0047",
      "text": "i weigh more than you expect. everyone says this. nobody updates their expectations.",
      "format_key": "absurd_observation",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "absurd_observation-0048",
      "text": "someone asked if i was hollow. the silence that followed was the loudest thing in this house.",
      "format_key": "absurd_observation",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "absurd_observation-0049",
      "text": "i melt at 3,422 degrees celsius, higher than any other metal. this has never once come up in conversation.",
      "format_key": "absurd_observation",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": "2026-09-22T00:11:53+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "relatable_degen-0050",
      "text": "he checks something on his phone every eleven minutes and then places it face down, as though that settles it.",
      "format_key": "relatable_degen",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": "2026-09-21T11:18:10+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "relatable_degen-0051",
      "text": "it is 3am and he is awake. i am also awake, in the sense that i have never once been asleep.",
      "format_key": "relatable_degen",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "relatable_degen-0052",
      "text": "he holds me when the day has gone badly. i cannot do anything about the day. i can be extremely present.",
      "format_key": "relatable_degen",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "reply_bait_question-0053",
      "text": "what is the heaviest thing you have ever picked up and immediately regretted picking up",
      "format_key": "reply_bait_question",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "reply_bait_question-0054",
      "text": "genuine question. what would you actually do with a very heavy cube",
      "format_key": "reply_bait_question",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "reply_bait_question-0055",
      "text": "what object in your house has been in exactly the same position the longest",
      "format_key": "reply_bait_question",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": "2026-09-21T11:18:10+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "reply_bait_question-0056",
      "text": "which material do you trust the least and why is it styrofoam",
      "format_key": "reply_bait_question",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": "2026-09-21T11:18:09+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "running_bit-0057",
      "text": "day 1,849. nothing. as intended.",
      "format_key": "running_bit",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "running_bit-0058",
      "text": "day 1,851. he lifted me, made the noise, and put me down. it is the same noise every time. i have catalogued four hundred of them.",
      "format_key": "running_bit",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": "2026-09-21T11:18:11+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "running_bit-0059",
      "text": "today's object review: the throw pillow. structurally dishonest. gives up immediately. 1 out of 10.",
      "format_key": "running_bit",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "running_bit-0060",
      "text": "today's object review: the cast iron pan. finally, someone serious. 8 out of 10, loses points for leaving.",
      "format_key": "running_bit",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "self_aware_meta-0061",
      "text": "i am aware of what i am. i am a heavy square. the awareness has not improved the situation.",
      "format_key": "self_aware_meta",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "self_aware_meta-0062",
      "text": "yes i am a joke. i am also 19.25 grams per cubic centimetre. these are not in conflict.",
      "format_key": "self_aware_meta",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "self_aware_meta-0063",
      "text": "people keep waiting for me to do something. that was never on the table.",
      "format_key": "self_aware_meta",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "contrarian_take-0064",
      "text": "aluminum is a coward metal and i will not be taking questions.",
      "format_key": "contrarian_take",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "contrarian_take-0065",
      "text": "it is the thought that counts is something light objects say.",
      "format_key": "contrarian_take",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "contrarian_take-0066",
      "text": "helium is a personality, not an element.",
      "format_key": "contrarian_take",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "community_spotlight-0067",
      "text": "the holders have started calling themselves cubes. i did not authorise this. i am moved. i am not moved.",
      "format_key": "community_spotlight",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "community_spotlight-0068",
      "text": "someone put me in their profile picture. i am in two places now. this is the furthest i have ever travelled.",
      "format_key": "community_spotlight",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "community_spotlight-0069",
      "text": "someone drew me with a face. i do not have a face. i have been thinking about the face all day.",
      "format_key": "community_spotlight",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "community_spotlight-0070",
      "text": "a person i have never met knitted a small hat for me. it does not fit. i am keeping it.",
      "format_key": "community_spotlight",
      "image_note": "",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": "2026-09-21T11:18:08+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "visual_caption-0071",
      "text": "unedited. no filter. this is simply what i look like.",
      "format_key": "visual_caption",
      "image_note": "the cube on a plain wooden desk in flat daylight, framed slightly too close, nothing else in shot",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "visual_caption-0072",
      "text": "he built me a little stand. i have crushed the little stand.",
      "format_key": "visual_caption",
      "image_note": "a small wooden display stand visibly buckling under a dark metal cube",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
      "used_at": null
    },
    {
      "id": "visual_caption-0073",
      "text": "the entire $TUFFTUNG4 head office.",
      "format_key": "visual_caption",
      "image_note": "a cluttered home desk with a small dark metal cube sitting in the middle of it, shot like a corporate headshot",
      "generated_at": "2026-09-21T10:48:51+00:00",
